|-------|----------|--------|
| Foundation / Under Construction | `(0.58, 0.62, 0.58)` | Desaturated gray-green |
| Operational | `Color.WHITE` | Full intended art |
| Damaged | `(0.82, 0.55, 0.42)` | Warm damaged tint |
| Destroyed | `(0.22, 0.22, 0.24, 0.8)` | Darkened |

