Current runtime step: before a separate destination/travel UI exists, `ContractWorldLoader` places an export-controlled far-field resource patch inside the generated contract map. This is the first expedition-scale placement slice: it uses procgen floor/region/intensity metadata, stays outside the compound and road/parking lanes, and spawns the full compatible node preset set as non-respawning local resources.

