func is_piloted() -> bool
```

Expected node tree:
```
PilotableVehicle
├── CollisionShape2D
├── Sprite2D or AnimatedSprite2D
├── EntryArea2D
│   └── CollisionShape2D
├── DriverSeat
└── ExitMarker
