```
NONE, COVER_ONLY, HAZARD, OBJECTIVE, ENTERABLE, PILOTABLE, SUMMONED,
DEPLOYABLE, WRECKAGE, ENEMY_PLATFORM
```

First production vehicle uses `interaction_mode: PILOTABLE`.

