- `undercroft_black_rock_outer_corner_ne/nw/se/sw`
- `undercroft_foundation_wall_n/e/s/w`
- `undercroft_foundation_wall_cracked_n/e/s/w`
- `undercroft_arch_support_wall_n/e/s/w`
- `undercroft_drain_gate_wall_n/e/s/w`
